    <entry_item>
      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠳᠠᠩᠳᠠᠭᠠᠨ</unicode>
      <uighur>dangdaγan</uighur>
      <cyrillic>дандаа</cyrillic>
      <transcript>DANGDAΓAN</transcript>
      <definition>[= dang daγan] adv. All the time, always; entirely</definition>
      <page>230</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠠᠩᠳᠠᠭᠠᠨ ᠪᠣᠷᠤᠭᠠᠨ ᠣᠷᠤᠵᠤ ᠪᠠᠶᠢᠨ᠎ᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- boruγan oruzu bain-a</transcript>
          <definition> It is raining all the time</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠠᠩᠳᠠᠭᠠᠨ ᠮᠢᠨᠤ ᠲᠠᠨᠢᠯ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- minu tanil</transcript>
          <definition> All [are] my acquaintances.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
    <entry_item>
      <dico>Chinese</dico>
      <unicode>ᠳᠠᠩᠳᠠ ᠪᠠᠨ</unicode>
      <cyrillic>дандаа</cyrillic>
      <definition>〔副〕①总是，时常，经常，往往，大概：~ салхилж байна 总是刮风，时常刮风；~ тийм зантай хүн 总是那样脾气的人；~ хэл ам таталж явах хэрэг юун! 干嘛总是絮絮叨叨地纠缠不休！②完全是，都是，整个地：~ миний танил 全是我的熟人.</definition>
      <page>389</page>
    </entry_item>
